  "description": "From cooking, to cleaning, to everything in between, Ha-yeon is the perfect housekeeper! There’s just one issue… Woojin, who translates erotic novels for a living, keeps seeing his hottie of a housekeeper in his fantasies! Maybe it’s just Woojin’s lack of bedroom experience making him sexually frustrated but he’s gotta take care of this situation before things get out of hand. Woojin’s old friend, the mischievous Sol, sends him something to try to help him out, but when Ha-yeon catches Woojin in a most compromising position with the gift, will this shocking discovery be too big a load for the both of them to bear?! \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 22 side stories.*",
